unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: var(--lsr-color);">Left-SR</span> — Former law student, journalist, and expert in local affairs.<ul>Overall skill: ★★☆<br>Suitability: ★★★★</ul>[?if coalition_government = 0 : We haven't assented to Left-SR participation in government. ?][?if labor_minister == "Trutovsky" : Trutovsky already has a post. ?]
